Package: mixedcheck
Title: Design Audits and Diagnostics for Mixed-Effects Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Bernabeu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pcbernabeu@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1083-2460"))
Description: Audits study designs before mixed-effects models are fitted
    and diagnoses and reports fitted models. The registry of checks, the
    schemas and the test fixtures are shared with the 'Python' package of
    the same name.
